{"actor": "system", "cost_usd": 0.0, "event_type": "finalize", "latency_ms": 1.0, "payload": {"final_answer": "The TJX Companies, Inc. (TJX) **beat** its Q4 FY 2025 pre-tax margin guidance by **60 basis points (bps)**.\n\nAccording to the company's Q3 FY 2025 earnings report and subsequent guidance updates, TJX initially projected a Q4 FY 2025 pre-tax profit margin of **11.3%**. In its Q4 FY 2025 earnings release on February 26, 2025, the company reported an actual consolidated pre-tax profit margin of **11.9%**. The difference between the actual result (11.9%) and the guidance (11.3%) is 0.6 percentage points, which equates to a **60 bps beat**.\n\nThe strong performance was primarily driven by consolidated comparable store sales increasing 5%, which was well above the company's plan, and an increase in customer transactions.\n\nFINAL ANSWER: TJX beat its Q4 FY 2025 pre-tax margin guidance by 60 BPS.\n\n{\n    \"sources\": [\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://investor.tjx.com/news-releases/news-release-details/tjx-companies-inc-reports-q3-fy25-results-comp-store-sales\",\n            \"name\": \"The TJX Companies, Inc. Reports Q3 FY25 Results; Comp Store Sales Up 3%; Increases Full Year Guidance for EPS and Pretax Profit Margin\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://www.tjx.com/docs/default-source/investor-docs/quarterly-results/tjx-fourth-quarter-fiscal-year-2025-earnings-press-release.pdf\",\n            \"name\": \"TJX Fourth Quarter Fiscal Year 2025 Earnings Press Release\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4739106-the-tjx-companies-inc-tjx-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript\",\n            \"name\": \"The TJX Companies, Inc. (TJX) Q3 2025 Earnings Call Transcript\"\n        }\n    ]\n}", "final_reason": "single_agent", "retrieved_docids": ["2025", "25", "3", "4739106"], "status": "completed", "success": true}, "state_id": "run_0_finalize", "timestamp_end": 1774525838.9930809, "timestamp_star